*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0042
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-01-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 647
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0042.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FEE0042C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 FEE-WAIVED         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM FEE-CONCESSION
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVED=" FEE-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
FEE-CONCESSION.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> STUDENT FEE WAIVER
        WHEN STUDENT-IND = 'Y' AND CLNT-AGE LESS THAN 24
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
        WHEN CLNT-AGE >= 60
            MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 9 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
